n New York Wants Democrats to Pass a \u2018Trans Bill of Rights\u2019 if They Win Midterms (VIDEO)\n", "post_created_at": "2026-10-07T02:51:23+00:00", "lat": 40.7127281, "lng": -74.0060152, "location_text": "New York", "mapped_location": "New York, United States", "precision": "state", "confidence": 0.95, "candidate_index": 1, "candidate_total": 1, "other_locations": null, "inserted_at": "2026-10-07T03:10:19.910029"}, {"pin_id": "at://did:plc:ghrptav4bpyctziyada6hids/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxawsl5op22t__1", "post_uri": "at://did:plc:ghrptav4bpyctziyada6hids/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxawsl5op22t", "post_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/themadcentrist.com/post/3mxawsl5op22t", "handle": "themadcentrist.com", "text": "Unless, of course, they are in New York with the Rape Law loop hole.\n\nWhich is despicable, disgusting, and inexcusable. \n\nLegislation has been introduced just about every single year to close this loop hole, but for some ungodly reason it never passes.\n\nNY, get it done.", "post_created_at": "2026-10-07T02:51:28.100Z", "lat": 40.7127281, "lng": -74.0060152, "location_text": "New York", "mapped_location": "New York, United States", "precision": "state", "confidence": 0.95, "candidate_index": 1, "candidate_total": 1, "other_locations": null, "inserted_at": "2026-10-07T03:10:20.972108"}, {"pin_id": "at://did:plc:3pcnghkif2l2bf3g3hx5spsu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxawwyxueu2r__1", "post_uri": "at://did:plc:3pcnghkif2l2bf3g3hx5spsu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxawwyxueu2r", "post_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/babyshoes4cash.com/post/3mxawwyxueu2r", "handle": "babyshoes4cash.com", "text": "As for Tom, the fct that hye \"had some woman in New york\": was really less surprising than that he had been depressed by a book. Something was making him nubble at the edge of stale ideas as if his studyr phsycial egotism not longer nouished his peremptyory heart", "post_created_at": "2026-10-07T02:53:56.419Z", "lat": 40.7127281, "lng": -74.0060152, "location_text": "New york", "mapped_loca